    {"id":"file:src-tauri/src/bin/api.rs","type":"file","name":"api.rs","filePath":"src-tauri/src/bin/api.rs","summary":"面向浏览器联调的本地 HTTP API 二进制，复用桌面 app_router，并仅在该旁路挂载 Scalar 与 OpenAPI JSON。服务监听 127.0.0.1:8787。","tags":["入口点","开发服务","axum","openapi"],"complexity":"simple","languageNotes":"使用 #[tokio::main] 启动异步 runtime，并把共享 Router 与开发期文档路由组合后交给 axum::serve。"},
