    {"id":"file:src-tauri/src/main.rs","type":"file","name":"main.rs","filePath":"src-tauri/src/main.rs","summary":"桌面二进制的最小入口，在 Windows release 下隐藏控制台并调用库 crate 的 run 启动 Tauri 应用。","tags":["入口点","tauri","rust","桌面应用"],"complexity":"simple"},
    {"id":"config:src-tauri/tauri.conf.json","type":"config","name":"tauri.conf.json","filePath":"src-tauri/tauri.conf.json","summary":"配置 Tauri 产品身份、Vite 开发与构建命令、主窗口属性、安全策略，以及默认 NSIS 打包目标和平台图标。","tags":["配置","tauri","桌面窗口","打包"],"complexity":"simple"},
    {"id":"file:src-tauri/tests/todos_api.rs","type":"file","name":"todos_api.rs","filePath":"src-tauri/tests/todos_api.rs","summary":"通过 axum Router oneshot 和临时 SQLite 文件集成测试 health 与 todos API，覆盖空列表、创建、校验、更新、删除和 404 行为。","tags":["test","api-集成测试","axum","sqlite"],"complexity":"moderate","languageNotes":"测试直接驱动 tower::ServiceExt::oneshot，避免真实 TCP 端口，并用 NamedTempFile 隔离每个测试的数据库。"},
